# Authored source for the companion chart, published for reference.
#
# Served as plain text, exactly as /reports/.htaccess already does for the .md
# report sources: this file is a COMPLETE standalone HTML document, and left as
# text/html the server would render it as a second, unstyled copy of the page it
# builds into (/reports/conn/ct-vs-us/indicators/). As text/plain the browser
# shows the source instead, which is the only reason to publish it — so the file
# can be read or handed on from any machine without a checkout.
#
# No RewriteEngine here on purpose: this directory inherits the document root's
# ruleset, including the https redirect fix and the /<dir>/idx listing route. A
# RewriteEngine directive would cut that inheritance and need its own copy.
AddType "text/plain; charset=utf-8" .html
